  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One thing I think needs to be updated is the coloring difference when there is no audio playing through your mic vs when audio is playing in your mic. In some worlds you can’t even tell if your mic is working at all. The color just isn’t drastic enough to tell the difference. I don’t really know when the coloring changed because I do remember it being fine at one point but over time it has gotten to the dimmer state that it is in.",
